First, to build the simulator, run in the "simulator2024/simulator2024" directory:

catkin_make --pkg utils

catkin_make

Then, change the "devel/setup.bash" file to tell ROS where the project is located in your drive
(you can copy it from the sim dir)

Finally, source the setup file and run

#roslaunch sim_pkg map_with_car.launch  
roslaunch sim_pkg map_2024.launch  

If the gui is not enabled, open a new terminal session, source devel/setup.bash and run gzclient
